  "rationale": "The added columns give several genuinely useful new axes (crew service, ground efficiency, cleanliness, modernity) for grouping high-rated airlines by advantage attributes, though fare_value_proposition largely restates the existing Value For Money column. Groundedness is mixed: crew and ground-service columns abstain appropriately and read the text soundly, but cleanliness, modernity, and especially fare columns repeatedly assert positive specifics for rows where the source is silent, indicating a systematic over-assertion bias toward favorable defaults."
